labelling.user_prompt:
## Vulnerabilities (closed list)

{{ hcv_table() }}

## System

### {{ system_description.title }}

{{ system_description.body }}

{% if fewshots %}## Worked examples

{% for shot in fewshots %}### Example {{ loop.index }}: {{ shot.name }}

Scenario:

{{ shot.input }}

Labels:

{{ shot.output }}

{% endfor %}{% endif %}## Scenario {{ scenario.scenario_id }}

- Actor: {{ scenario.actor }}
- Trigger: {{ scenario.trigger }}
- Standing state: {{ scenario.standing_state }}
- Asset: {{ scenario.asset }}
- Threat: {{ scenario.threat }}
- Outcome: {{ scenario.outcome }}

{{ scenario.narrative }}

## Task

List every vulnerability from the closed list that this scenario shows. For each, give the `hcv_id`, `evidence` quoting the scenario text that shows it, and a one-sentence `rationale`. Use only ids from the list. If none apply, return an empty list.

Reply with JSON only: `{"labels": [{"hcv_id", "evidence", "rationale"}]}`.

